1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,380
At one minute past one in the morning, Eastern

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:08,760
Time, American helicopters reached a fortified compound in Caracas.

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,780
Inside was Venezuela's president, Nicolás Maduro.

4
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,600
About two and a half hours later, he was

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:14,959
gone.

6
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:18,593
This is how the United States did it.

7
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:20,473
It was not one daring raid.

8
00:00:20,473 --> 00:00:24,073
It was months of spying, rehearsal and patience.

9
00:00:24,073 --> 00:00:26,973
Then came a whole air armada, built to protect

10
00:00:26,973 --> 00:00:29,175
a few helicopters for about two hours.

11
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:35,493
The target was Nicolás Maduro, Venezuela's president since twenty

12
00:00:35,493 --> 00:00:35,753
thirteen.

13
00:00:35,753 --> 00:00:39,033
In twenty twenty, federal prosecutors in New York charged

14
00:00:39,033 --> 00:00:40,773
him with narco-terrorism.

15
00:00:40,773 --> 00:00:42,095
He denies the charges.

16
00:00:43,167 --> 00:00:45,467
Washington kept raising the price on his head.

17
00:00:45,467 --> 00:00:49,147
In August twenty twenty five, it doubled the reward

18
00:00:49,147 --> 00:00:52,167
for his arrest to fifty million dollars.

19
00:00:52,167 --> 00:00:54,367
Five months later, it came for him itself.

20
00:00:55,433 --> 00:00:57,453
First came the build-up.

21
00:00:57,453 --> 00:01:01,073
In September twenty twenty five, the United States began

22
00:01:01,073 --> 00:01:03,673
striking boats it said were carrying drugs.

23
00:01:03,673 --> 00:01:07,295
In mid November, the world's largest aircraft carrier arrived.

24
00:01:08,367 --> 00:01:09,747
The Gerald R.

25
00:01:09,747 --> 00:01:11,987
Ford entered the Caribbean on the sixteenth of November,

26
00:01:11,987 --> 00:01:15,047
with more than four thousand sailors.

27
00:01:15,047 --> 00:01:18,487
The deployment was named Operation Southern Spear.

28
00:01:18,487 --> 00:01:21,807
By then, American ships sat off Venezuela's coast.

29
00:01:22,867 --> 00:01:24,987
The boat strikes kept coming.

30
00:01:24,987 --> 00:01:27,007
By the nineteenth of December, there had been twenty

31
00:01:27,007 --> 00:01:27,767
eight known strikes.

32
00:01:27,767 --> 00:01:31,367
At least one hundred four people were killed, according

33
00:01:31,367 --> 00:01:33,384
to the administration's own figures.

34
00:01:34,467 --> 00:01:37,207
The ship that mattered most was this one, the

35
00:01:37,207 --> 00:01:42,427
amphibious assault ship USS Iwo Jima, already in the

36
00:01:42,427 --> 00:01:42,747
Caribbean.

37
00:01:42,747 --> 00:01:46,227
Special operations helicopters would launch from her deck, and

38
00:01:46,227 --> 00:01:47,288
Maduro would end up aboard.

39
00:01:48,367 --> 00:01:51,707
Fighter jets were seen launching from Puerto Rico, about

40
00:01:51,707 --> 00:01:55,227
eight hundred ninety kilometres north of Caracas.

41
00:01:55,227 --> 00:01:57,767
In all, aircraft would take off from twenty different

42
00:01:57,767 --> 00:02:00,015
bases, on land and at sea.

43
00:02:01,067 --> 00:02:03,147
Next, they had to know exactly where he would

44
00:02:03,147 --> 00:02:04,247
be.

45
00:02:04,247 --> 00:02:07,087
General Dan Caine said intelligence teams studied how Maduro

46
00:02:07,087 --> 00:02:09,107
moved and where he lived.

47
00:02:09,107 --> 00:02:11,287
They knew what he ate, what he wore, even

48
00:02:11,287 --> 00:02:12,767
his pets.

49
00:02:12,767 --> 00:02:16,064
Caine credited the CIA, the NSA and the NGA.

50
00:02:17,133 --> 00:02:20,533
According to people familiar with the operation, a small

51
00:02:20,533 --> 00:02:24,753
CIA team was inside Venezuela from August.

52
00:02:24,753 --> 00:02:28,013
Reuters' sources describe an informant close to Maduro, tracking

53
00:02:28,013 --> 00:02:29,393
his movements.

54
00:02:29,393 --> 00:02:31,469
By early December, the force was set.

55
00:02:32,533 --> 00:02:34,093
Then they practised.

56
00:02:34,093 --> 00:02:37,553
Troops, including Delta Force, rehearsed on a replica of

57
00:02:37,553 --> 00:02:40,913
Maduro's safe house, built from intelligence.

58
00:02:40,913 --> 00:02:43,893
Trump said they even trained with massive blowtorches, to

59
00:02:43,893 --> 00:02:45,184
cut through steel walls.

60
00:02:46,267 --> 00:02:48,027
There was also a warning.

61
00:02:48,027 --> 00:02:50,147
About a week before the raid, Trump says he

62
00:02:50,147 --> 00:02:52,327
told Maduro on a phone call that he had

63
00:02:52,327 --> 00:02:53,647
to surrender.

64
00:02:53,647 --> 00:02:54,437
Maduro stayed.

65
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,780
Then they waited.

66
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:59,640
The force sat ready through Christmas and New Year.

67
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,540
The obstacle was the weather.

68
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:04,320
Ocean, mountains and low cloud made the flight too

69
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,569
risky on most nights.

70
00:03:06,633 --> 00:03:08,333
Why wait at all?

71
00:03:08,333 --> 00:03:11,213
Caine said the date was chosen for three reasons.

72
00:03:11,213 --> 00:03:12,933
Fewer civilians hurt.

73
00:03:12,933 --> 00:03:14,133
Maximum surprise.

74
00:03:14,133 --> 00:03:16,913
And the two indicted people kept unharmed, so they

75
00:03:16,913 --> 00:03:17,855
could stand trial.

76
00:03:18,933 --> 00:03:21,433
On the second of January, the weather broke just

77
00:03:21,433 --> 00:03:22,333
enough.

78
00:03:22,333 --> 00:03:25,393
At ten forty six PM Eastern, the president gave

79
00:03:25,393 --> 00:03:26,353
the order.

80
00:03:26,353 --> 00:03:29,313
The message passed to the whole force was simple.

81
00:03:29,313 --> 00:03:30,859
Good luck, and Godspeed.

82
00:03:31,933 --> 00:03:34,213
What followed was enormous.

83
00:03:34,213 --> 00:03:36,973
More than one hundred fifty aircraft took off from

84
00:03:36,973 --> 00:03:39,833
twenty bases across the Western Hemisphere.

85
00:03:39,833 --> 00:03:41,553
All of them were timed to meet over a

86
00:03:41,553 --> 00:03:42,973
single city.

87
00:03:42,973 --> 00:03:45,313
Thousands of hours of flying experience were in the

88
00:03:45,313 --> 00:03:46,440
air, Caine said.

89
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:48,980
Caine listed them.

90
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:52,740
F twenty twos, F thirty fives and F eighteens.

91
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:55,400
E A eighteen jets that jam radar.

92
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,020
E two radar planes.

93
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:57,860
B one bombers.

94
00:03:57,860 --> 00:03:59,340
And numerous drones.

95
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:01,480
The crews were between twenty and forty nine years

96
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:01,815
old.

97
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:05,687
All of it existed to protect a handful of

98
00:04:05,687 --> 00:04:06,527
helicopters.

99
00:04:06,527 --> 00:04:09,367
They skimmed the sea at about a hundred feet,

100
00:04:09,367 --> 00:04:12,787
carrying the assault force and law enforcement officers.

101
00:04:12,787 --> 00:04:15,219
The timing was the darkest hours of the night.

102
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:20,280
Videos analysed by The Aviationist suggest the Army's elite

103
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:24,860
helicopter regiment, the hundred and sixtieth, flew the mission.

104
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:27,000
Its Chinooks carried the troops.

105
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,356
Armed Black Hawks like this one gave close support.

106
00:04:30,433 --> 00:04:33,253
As they neared the coast, the United States began

107
00:04:33,253 --> 00:04:35,013
layering effects.

108
00:04:35,013 --> 00:04:38,033
Space Command and Cyber Command acted first, to create

109
00:04:38,033 --> 00:04:39,193
a pathway.

110
00:04:39,193 --> 00:04:42,593
Then jets began dismantling Venezuela's air defences.

111
00:04:43,667 --> 00:04:45,967
Then Caracas went dark.

112
00:04:45,967 --> 00:04:48,187
Trump said the city's lights were largely turned off

113
00:04:48,187 --> 00:04:50,727
by a certain American expertise.

114
00:04:50,727 --> 00:04:53,047
The White House never said how.

115
00:04:53,047 --> 00:04:55,827
Analysts suggested a strike on the grid, or a

116
00:04:55,827 --> 00:04:56,445
cyber attack.

117
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:00,440
Explosions were reported along the coast.

118
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,820
The port of La Guaira was damaged.

119
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:06,800
At Higuerote, about ninety kilometres east, a Russian made

120
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,660
Buk air defence system was reportedly destroyed.

121
00:05:10,733 --> 00:05:13,453
To reach the city, the helicopters had to cross

122
00:05:13,453 --> 00:05:15,493
the coastal mountains.

123
00:05:15,493 --> 00:05:17,113
Caine said they hid in the clutter of the

124
00:05:17,113 --> 00:05:18,153
high ground.

125
00:05:18,153 --> 00:05:20,853
When they crossed the last ridge, he judged that

126
00:05:20,853 --> 00:05:21,933
surprise was total.

127
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:28,100
Their target was Fort Tiuna, Venezuela's largest military complex,

128
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:30,340
according to Venezuelan officials.

129
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:33,360
Nearby, the La Carlota air base was also reported

130
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:33,795
hit.

131
00:05:34,867 --> 00:05:37,727
At one minute past one Eastern, one minute past

132
00:05:37,727 --> 00:05:42,147
two in Caracas, the helicopters reached Maduro's compound.

133
00:05:42,147 --> 00:05:44,607
They came under fire, and answered with what Caine

134
00:05:44,607 --> 00:05:46,259
called overwhelming force.

135
00:05:47,333 --> 00:05:49,433
One helicopter was hit.

136
00:05:49,433 --> 00:05:51,973
It stayed in the air, and every American aircraft

137
00:05:51,973 --> 00:05:53,593
made it home.

138
00:05:53,593 --> 00:05:57,153
Overhead, intelligence teams fed the ground force live updates

139
00:05:57,153 --> 00:05:58,789
as it moved through the compound.

140
00:05:59,867 --> 00:06:03,727
Inside, officials told CBS News that Delta Force led

141
00:06:03,727 --> 00:06:07,607
the assault, alongside FBI agents.

142
00:06:07,607 --> 00:06:10,307
Trump said Maduro ran for a steel safe room,

143
00:06:10,307 --> 00:06:12,091
but did not reach the door in time.

144
00:06:13,167 --> 00:06:16,427
Caine said Maduro and his wife, Cilia Flores, gave

145
00:06:16,427 --> 00:06:17,267
up.

146
00:06:17,267 --> 00:06:20,487
Legally, this was an arrest by the Justice Department.

147
00:06:20,487 --> 00:06:22,907
The military's job was to get the arrest team

148
00:06:22,907 --> 00:06:24,217
in, and get it out.

149
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:27,840
Getting out was its own fight.

150
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:30,720
Fighters and drones covered the helicopters through several more

151
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,020
firefights.

152
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:34,520
At three twenty nine Eastern, they were back over

153
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,960
open water.

154
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:38,980
Trump announced the capture on social media less than

155
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:39,785
an hour later.

156
00:06:40,867 --> 00:06:44,207
Maduro was flown to the USS Iwo Jima, then

157
00:06:44,207 --> 00:06:47,207
to Guantanamo Bay, then to New York.

158
00:06:47,207 --> 00:06:49,767
He landed at Stewart Air National Guard Base that

159
00:06:49,767 --> 00:06:50,927
afternoon.

160
00:06:50,927 --> 00:06:52,835
In court, he pleaded not guilty.

161
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:56,220
No Americans were killed.

162
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:58,460
Officials said several were injured.

163
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:01,680
Cuba said thirty two of its officers, protecting Maduro,

164
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,800
died.

165
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,480
Venezuela acknowledged deaths, but has not given a full

166
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:05,911
count.

167
00:07:06,967 --> 00:07:08,707
So what was the strategy?

168
00:07:08,707 --> 00:07:10,947
Know exactly where the target will be.

169
00:07:10,947 --> 00:07:13,067
Rehearse on a copy of his house.

170
00:07:13,067 --> 00:07:14,667
Wait for the right night.

171
00:07:14,667 --> 00:07:17,487
Then blind the defences, and surround a few helicopters

172
00:07:17,487 --> 00:07:18,743
with an air force.

173
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:22,780
Caine summed up the air plan in one line.

174
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:25,780
The air component exists to protect the helicopters and

175
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:27,120
the ground force.

176
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,940
Its job is to get them to the target,

177
00:07:28,940 --> 00:07:30,275
and to get them home.

178
00:07:31,333 --> 00:07:33,553
Much is still unconfirmed.

179
00:07:33,553 --> 00:07:36,593
The Pentagon has not officially named the units.

180
00:07:36,593 --> 00:07:38,613
It has not explained the blackout.

181
00:07:38,613 --> 00:07:42,313
And the death toll in Venezuela remains incomplete.

182
00:07:42,313 --> 00:07:44,653
Caine also said there is always a chance they

183
00:07:44,653 --> 00:07:46,117
will be asked to do this again.

184
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:49,280
The raid on Caracas took about two and a

185
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,380
half hours.

186
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:53,740
It worked because almost everything around it was slow,

187
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:55,540
patient and enormous.

188
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:57,461
The fast part was the smallest part.
